<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25772" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρτ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suspend,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, dub. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαττᾶσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				34.9.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>keep in suspense, keep engaged,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>
			<i>in</i> or <i>by . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.46
			</span></i>; <i>mislead, deceive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				1006
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to separate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδύμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.303
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.10.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δύναμιν ἀπὸ Συρακουσῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηρτημένα ἀπ᾽ ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					5.3.7
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα τοῦ ὅλου διαρτηθέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.509
				</span></i>
			; <i>dismember,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.9.5
			</span></i>; <i>interrupt,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀκολουθίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηρτημένων τῶν λέξεων</span>”
				<i>forced apart,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηρτημένων . . φωνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.Lac.
					1014.48
				</span></i>
			 F.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηρτῆσθαι,</span> of argument,
				<i>to lack connexion, be incoherent,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηρτημένα τινὰ καὶ ψευδῆ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				46F.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.153
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρτίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
